# Build context is the repo root so the Dockerfile can COPY src/ plus the lockfile.
# Everything else would only thrash the layer cache on a docs edit.
*
!src/
!SKILL.md
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
# The MCP image installs the checkout's package rather than silently pulling an older
# release from PyPI. Keep only the package metadata and sources in the context.
!mcp/
!mcp/pyproject.toml
!mcp/README.md
!mcp/LICENSE
!mcp/NOTICE
!mcp/src/
!mcp/src/technocore_mcp/
